    "text": "A simple harmonic wave of amplitude<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>unit travels along the positive x-axis. At given instant of time, for a particle at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> from the origin, the displacement is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math> unit and for a particle at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> from the origin, the displacement is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo></math>unit. Calculate the wavelength.",
